\\nDate: <DATE>\\n\\nOverview\\n---------\\nThis specification details every frame, interaction, annotation and WCAG-AA consideration needed for the “News & Events” content workflow inside Strapi’s admin interface.  When implemented in Figma (page 02_Admin of the project “HOA Website – Low-Fi / Admin / Style Guide”), designers will create grey-box wireframes for three breakpoints—Desktop (1440×1024), Tablet (768×1024), Mobile (375×812)—and attach comments as indicated.\\n\\nFRAME GROUPS & NAMING\\n=====================\\nGroup each breakpoint top-to-bottom in the canvas:\\n1. Desktop /1440\\n2. Tablet /768\\n3. Mobile /375\\n\\nInside each group, place the following frames in order:\\n A. Dashboard – News & Events Overview Widget\\n B. News & Events – List View\\n C. News & Events – Create / Edit (WYSIWYG)\\n D. File Library Modal (overlaid on C)\\n\\nFor clarity: frame names e.g. “D-1440_File-Library-Modal”.\\n\\nGLOBAL LAYOUT\\n-------------\\n• Left Sidebar (role-based navigation; 240 px desktop, 72 px collapsed tablet, off-canvas mobile).\\n• Top Admin Bar: Strapi logo, environment badge, user avatar, shortcuts.\\n• Main Content Area: 12-column fluid grid (max-width 1160 px on desktop).\\n• Base Grid: 8 px spacing.\\n\\nROLE-BASED NAVIGATION\\n=====================\\nSidebar Items per Role (show/hide):\\n Admin: Dashboard, Content-Types, Media-Library, News & Events, Users, Roles & Permissions, Settings.\\n Editor: Dashboard, News & Events, Media-Library.\\n Contributor: Dashboard, News & Events (read/create, no publish), Media-Library (upload only).\\n Viewer: Dashboard, News & Events (read-only).\\n\\nIcons only in collapsed state; tooltips on hover.  Mobile: hamburger button toggles drawer overlay (side-in animation, ARIA role=\\\"dialog\\\" aria-label=\\\"Navigation\\\").\\n\\nA. DASHBOARD – NEWS & EVENTS OVERVIEW WIDGET\\n===========================================\\nCard (region) 420 × 260 px (desktop) containing:\\n• Heading h2 “News & Events Overview”.\\n• Counts Row (flex):\\n   Draft · Scheduled · Published · Archived (numeric badges, color-coded, aria-labelledby).\\n• Quick Links (list):\\n   – New Post (primary button)\\n   – View All (link)\\n   – Drafts (link)\\nKeyboard Tab order: heading → counts L-R → quick links top-bottom.\\n\\nResponsive:\\n • Tablet: card full-width, two-column counts.\\n • Mobile: counts stack, quick links row.\\n\\nB. LIST VIEW FRAME\\n==================\\nHeader Bar:\\n • Title “News & Events” (h1)\\n • + New button (primary)\\n\\nToolbar (below header):\\n • Search (input, 280 px desktop → 100% mobile)\\n • Status Filter (select: All, Draft, Scheduled, Published)\\n • Type Filter (select: News, Event)\\n • Bulk Actions dropdown (Publish, Unpublish, Delete)\\n\\nData Table Columns:\\n 1 Checkbox (select-all)\\n 2 Title (link) – TRUNCATE middle; tooltip full.\\n 3 Type (chip)\\n 4 Status (badge: Draft=grey, Scheduled=blue, Published=green, Archived=red)\\n 5 Updated (relative datetime)\\n 6 Author (avatar+name)\\n\\nInteractions:\\n • Row click opens Edit screen.\\n • Checkbox selects for bulk action; aria-describedby.\\n\\nPagination bottom-right (desktop) or centered (mobile). Keyboard navigable.\\n\\nResponsive:\\n • Tablet drops Author column.\\n • Mobile shows Card list variant: Title, Status badge, Updated.\\n\\nC. CREATE / EDIT FRAME (WYSIWYG)\\n================================\\nLeft Content Column (desktop 8/12):\\n 1 Slug (text, auto from Title; editable; helper link “Copy”)\\n 2 Title (text h1)\\n 3 WYSIWYG Editor – TipTap toolbar (grouped buttons):\\n   [B, I] • Heading dropdown • List ordered/unordered • Quote • Link • Image icon (opens File Library modal) • Undo/Redo.\\n   Editor area min-height 400 px.\\n 4 Excerpt (multi-line 3rows, char-count).\\n\\nRight Meta Column (desktop 4/12, sticky top 80 px):\\n • Status Panel: Radio – Draft, Published, Schedule (datetime picker)\\n • Visibility: Public, Members-only\\n • Actions: “Save Draft” (secondary), “Preview” (tertiary), “Publish” (primary)\\n\\nTablet: right meta panel collapses to accordion above content.\\nMobile: meta panel collapses to sliding drawer opened via “Post Options” button.\\n\\nFocus Management:\\n • On “Save Draft/Publish”, loading spinner in button, aria-live=\\\"polite\\\" status region announces success.\\n\\nD. FILE LIBRARY MODAL\\n=====================\\nModal (fullscreen overlay mobile; 920 × 640 px desktop) role=\\\"dialog\\\" aria-modal=\\\"true\\\" labelledby=\\\"Media Library\\\".\\nLayout:\\n • Header bar: Title + Close (Esc key closes)\\n • Top zone: Drag-and-drop area (100 % width, 120 px height); keyboard focusable; aria-label.\\n • Filters sidebar (desktop) / collapsible drawer (mobile): Folder select, Tag multi-select.\\n • Main Panel – Grid (thumbnails 160 px) with checkbox overlay; view toggle Grid/List.\\n • Search input (above grid).\\n • Pagination at bottom; infobar “24 files”.\\n\\nKeyboard:\\n • Tab cycle inside modal; focus trap.\\n • Arrow keys navigate thumbnails; Space to select.\\n\\nWCAG-AA & ARIA NOTES (ALL FRAMES)\\n----------------------------------\\n• Color contrast ≥ 4.5:1.\\n• Heading hierarchy h1→h2→h3.\\n• Interactive elements ≥ 44×44 px.\\n• Visible focus outline (#005FCC, 2 px) for all focusable items.\\n• ARIA roles: navigation, main, dialog, region, table, grid, listbox.\\n• aria-live for toast/alerts, status changes.\\n• Skip-link “Skip to main content” in top bar.\\n\\nANNOTATION IN FIGMA\\n-------------------\\nFor each interactive component, add a numbered callout (orange circle) and place corresponding comment:\\n #1 “Quick Links: links keyboard focusable, aria-labelled…” etc.\\nUse Comment format: **Title** – Description – WCAG Ref.\\n\\nRESPONSIVE SPECIFICS – SUMMARY\\n==============================\\n| Element            | Desktop (≥1280)             | Tablet (768-1279)              | Mobile (≤767)              |\\n|--------------------|-----------------------------|--------------------------------|----------------------------|\\n| Sidebar            | 240 px fixed               | 72 px collapsed toggleable     | Off-canvas overlay        |\\n| Grid Columns       | 12                          | 8                              | 4                          |\\n| Dashboard Cards    | 3-col row                  | 2-col row                     | 1-col stacked             |\\n| Table              | Full columns               | Drops Author                  | Card list                |\\n| Meta Panel (Edit)  | Sticky right               | Collapsible accordions         | Drawer                    |\\n| Modal              | 920×640 centred            | 100 % width, 100 % height      | Fullscreen                |\\n\\nIMPLEMENTATION CHECKLIST\\n------------------------\\n☐ Create frames per list above.\\n☐ Add sidebar variants and interactions.\\n☐ Insert numbered callouts, attach comments.\\n☐ Rename frames with prefix (breakpoint + label).\\n☐ Group frames per breakpoint.\\n☐ Add comment on page “Admin UI v1 complete”.\\n\\nEnd of document.\\n---END FILE CONTENT---\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}","genkit:output":"{\"candidates\":[{\"index\":0,\"finishReason\":\"stop\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"APPROVE\"}]},\"custom\":{}}],\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":1890,\"outputTokens\":213,\"totalTokens\":2103},\"custom\":{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-BxMFjQsMObDaZ61JUbq2zVkeYN7dX\",\"object\":\"chat.completion\",\"created\":1753486591,\"model\":\"o3-2025-04-16\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"APPROVE\",\"refusal\":null,\"annotations\":[]},\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}],\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":1890,\"completion_tokens\":213,\"total_tokens\":2103,\"prompt_tokens_details\":{\"cached_tokens\":0,\"audio_tokens\":0},\"completion_tokens_details\":{\"reasoning_tokens\":192,\"audio_tokens\":0,\"accepted_prediction_tokens\":0,\"rejected_prediction_tokens\":0}},\"service_tier\":\"default\",\"system_fingerprint\":null},\"lat